        {
          "id": 669437433,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "There is already a way to achieve this. See https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/bd36fe1bcbe19dd1b63836cc60d7351d7d8b4aa8 for the original implementation of this field, and especially the changes to `test/lua/listener.lua` on how to select the dissector to provide all fields.\n\nAlso note, that using all fields will impact performance drastically.",
